56
00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:48.000
helping hand that you didn't really have. Yes, and I'm glad that I can help the community to give them back. Because I know how it feels to be lost in a new place. Kareem worked at JBS for two years,
你当时并没有真正得到的帮助之手。是的，我很高兴我能帮助社区回馈他们。因为我知道在一个陌生的地方感到迷茫是什么感觉。卡里姆在JBS工作了两年，

